# Class declaration with functional dependency and resolver
# Verifies the new two-bracket class body syntax: [class [params] [determines:... resolver:...] methods...]
[
  # Define a test class with FD: (a, b) determines c
  # The resolver "TestAddResult" would compute c from (a, b) at type-stage
  TestAdd: [class [TestAdd a b c] [determines: [[[a b] c]] resolver: TestAddResult]
    test-add: [Fn@c [a b]]]

  # Return a simple value to verify the class declaration typechecks
  result: 42
]

---

%.result
=== out
Int(42)
